From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI coding assistant <assistant@local.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: isolate the first J714s GPU display trial

TripleU613 reports accelerated J714s operation with Linux DCP off:
https://github.com/TripleU613/Omarchy-M5-Pro/blob/13cc8196396ef2029ec0931f17fcb0ff9ad73c21/STATUS-2026-11-08.md

Retain this machine's voltage bins and live preflight, not the different
bins in draft rolotrealanis98/linux#1 at 77782baf9d4923e42b3bc20f2bb816789c5afba8.
The existing shared ID, board geometry and M5 render-policy admission already
rejects invalid/all-zero masks before firmware boot. Do not duplicate it or
reject a valid partially fused cluster.

Keep the DCP GPU DT and CPU fallbacks intact. This new DT requires the matching
m1n1 simpledrm opt-out patch, since an older loader can re-enable DCP nodes.
This is local AI-assisted integration, not a new hardware qualification.
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/Makefile
@@ -100,6 +100,7 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t6040-j616s-tether.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t6041-j616c.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t6050-j714s.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t6050-j714s-gpu.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t6050-j714s-gpu-simpledrm.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t8112-j413.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t8112-j415.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE) += t8112-j473.dtb
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714s-gpu-simpledrm.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714s-gpu-simpledrm.dts
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-j714s-gpu-simpledrm.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+ OR MIT
+/*
+ * Isolated first GPU trial: retain the inherited simple framebuffer rather
+ * than handing DCP to Linux. All DCP nodes are disabled in the shared board
+ * tree; the matching loader must honor this opt-out instead of enabling them.
+ * GPU voltage bins and all other board settings remain the local J714s ones.
+ */
+#include "t6050-j714s-gpu.dts"
+
+&dcp {
+	apple,m1n1-simpledrm-only;
+};
